1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,709
This is browse.

2
00:00:01,709 --> 00:00:04,482
A quiet, native browser for the Mac.

3
00:00:04,482 --> 00:00:09,948
Press Command S to hide the tabs, and give the page the whole window.

4
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:19,385
Move between tabs with Command Shift right bracket, and back with
Command Shift left bracket.

5
00:00:19,385 --> 00:00:22,557
The highlight slides to the tab you choose.

6
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:29,329
Within a tab, Command right bracket moves forward in page history.

7
00:00:29,329 --> 00:00:31,948
Command left bracket takes you back.

8
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:38,868
As you scroll, the tab fills to show how far you have read.

9
00:00:38,868 --> 00:00:44,165
It follows the page as you move down, and returns as you scroll back
up.

10
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:49,833
Less retyping.

11
00:00:49,833 --> 00:00:51,920
More room for the page.

12
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:53,817
Browse, for the Mac.
